OL,3,GNEWSATitanic saucers sell for almost
OL,4,A#47,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA set of three saucers intended for
OL,7,Ffirst-class passengers on the RMS
OL,8,FTitanic have sold at auction for
OL,9,F#46,800.
OL,11,FThe Copeland Spode demitasse saucers
OL,12,Fnever made it on board the White Star
OL,13,FLine ship, which sank on its maiden
OL,14,Fvoyage on 15 April 1912 with the loss
OL,15,Fof about 1,500 lives.
OL,17,FThe blue, white and gold items bear the
OL,18,Fgilt monogram for the Oceanic Steam
OL,19,FNavigation Company and were put up for
OL,20,Fsale by a collector in Kent.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
