OL,3,GNEWSATitanic saucers sell for almost
OL,4,A#47,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge-based auctioneers, Cheffins,
OL,7,Foriginally estimated they would fetch
OL,8,Fbetween #1,000 and #2,000 but a
OL,9,Fprolific Californian collector of
OL,10,FTitanic memorabilia paid more than 20
OL,11,Ftimes that to secure the saucers.
